Bridge 0121: port of ios-redfin bridge 0111 (sweet-scratch-trim; https://github.com/DenialOfGravity/ios-redfin 5cc0798, ce44728).
Leaves a memoryless color attachment no draw of its pass writes or reads out of the subpass (VK_ATTACHMENT_UNUSED, description kept), so a tiler keeps it out of tile memory.
Differs from redfin: no sweet_drawstat here (counts go to one MTL2 log line), no live knob, no redfin rp cache keys to mind.
Knob: SWEET_M2V_SCRATCH (off unless set and not 0; off = same results and same work as before).

